--- a/Changes
+++ b/Changes
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+Unreleased
+* Default the optional mmap offset in XS before reading it. This prevents
+  stale stack values from causing shifted mappings or SIGBUS when the
+  offset is omitted. Adapted from upstream PR #33:
+  https://github.com/cpan-authors/Sys-Mmap/pull/33
+  Keep the filehandle required to preserve the five-argument minimum.
+* Test omitted, undefined, zero, numeric and string offsets, and reject
+  calls without a filehandle.
+
 Todd Rinaldo, Mar 22 2026 v0.21
 
